# AI-BOS Vault Integrity

SSOT: **`RU-AI-BOS-VAULT-001`**.

## Mandatory for @system-builder

1. Create/edit agents, skills, rules, MCP, brain only under `AI-BOS/`.
2. If a file lives outside → **copy into vault** → then register.
3. `runtime_projection` must be `vault-skill:<name>` or `vault-agent:<name>`.
4. Never register host `.cursor/`, `.github/agents/`, or personal `~/.cursor/skills/` as canonical.

## Surfaces

| Surface | Path |
|---------|------|
| Agents | `AI-BOS/.cursor/agents/` |
| Skills | `AI-BOS/.cursor/skills/` |
| Rules | `AI-BOS/.cursor/rules/` |
| Brain | `AI-BOS/.cursor/brain/` |
| MCP | `AI-BOS/mcp/` |
